codex
The actual code already covers a few design points well: the app time zone is set to Eastern, the recurring cron entries include `America/New_York`, and the memory pull uses `git -c safe.directory=...` with terminal prompts disabled. I’m checking auth and boot paths now because those are the phone re-auth and first-boot failure surfaces.
