The Sunday re-auth flow mostly has the right shape: the emailed link points to `/schwab/authorize`, unauthenticated users are sent through magic-link login, and the session return target is preserved before Schwab OAuth starts. One subtle first-phone issue is whether the secure cookie and host/proxy settings survive dokku’s nginx path.
